                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Fortify is a fun tower defense game, in a more traditional sense in that you have to defend your medieval style castle. \n\nHire ranged and melee troops, collect resources by manning the outposts such as the lumbermill or quarry, and upgrade your castle and build traps.\n\nThe single player missions are slick with a good tutorial. Once you're confident take on your friends in 1v1 battles.\n\nFortify has really impressed me, but I'm not surprised as it's from the same dev as Terraform which is another very good game!\n\nDisclosure: Based on my experience of Terraform, I asked to help Jonas test Fortify so I had pre-release access to game for no charge. Jonas was very receptive to my comments and quickly implemented a few improvements to the game. Excellent dev support!",
